{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"851245990110560286","content":"🐺 The Wolf scoffs and stands up. \"I get it, I wronged you and her. But to be honest, I don't give two shits about your morals. You said yourself you had an unsavory past, and I can tell you have experience being a predator. I'm not so naive as to think you'll side with me, but I know you know what it's like to be in my position.\"\n🦌 Demetrius pauses for a moment, staring at the Wolf. When he speaks, his voice is rougher and louder. \"You are right. I am a savage prince with a hunter's bearing, and I have been in a similar position to you before. I have been the predator who killed something they should not have. But do not think **for even a second** that we are the same. You are evil throughout, I can see that. But I know you can also see in me that I was never so far gone as you. There was always a part of me willing and wanting to do good.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T09:47:01.230000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880025466222837760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
